Location

Pengadilan Federal DC, AS

Status

Ongoing

Immediate Result

Binance.US operasi terbatas (fiat off-ramp dicabut bank); BNB delist beberapa platform US; narasi regulasi "BNB = security" jadi fokus.

Sources

